# text_id = 904
# text = Dropping the friendliness for a moment and bringing the politics back into it straight , surely the hon . Gentleman would respect the devolved competences of the Scottish Government in agriculture and fishing in the new way of negotiation that the British Government plan to use to handle things in Brussels ?
