# text_id = 1072
# text = Although I am sure that many ordinary people were thrilled to learn that the Government ’s rule of six does not apply to so - called sports such as grouse shooting , for which up to 29 people can mingle , expectant mothers in my constituency and throughout the country are unable to take their partners to crucial checks during pregnancy .
