# text_id = 1073
# text = At the same time , the EU insists that in the hugely important area of fisheries , it should continue to have access on terms that are similar , if not identical , to the common fisheries policy , which so many people in this country recognise as having worked against the interests of our coastal communities and of marine conservation .
