# text_id = 1079
# text = My right hon . Friend knows how good Sedgemoor District Council is , but I do not know if my right hon . Friend is aware that it has just approved the imaginative plans for the Gravity site , on the M5 , of 600 acres , which even Elon Musk , I believe , has been down to see .
