# text_id = 1080
# text = The Government have consistently refused to confirm the numbers of those who contracted the coronavirus while staying at Napier barracks , but I understand that , out of around 400 people , 105 who did not have the virus were moved out , leaving us to draw our own conclusions about just how massive an outbreak took place there .
