# text_id = 1085
# text = We have an unprecedented opportunity in this country for a post - covid green revolution , which could generate thousands of jobs across the whole of the United Kingdom , but , once again , this Government have offered more of the same short - term ﬁxes ; it is business as usual and it is simply not good enough .
