# text_id = 1102
# text = I turn to the public health impact of this approach , because one of the major reasons that we ended up in a national lockdown was that , in the words of the Government ’s scientific advisers — the Scientific Advisory Group for Emergencies — test , trace and isolate was only having “ a marginal impact on transmission ” .
