# text_id = 1105
# text = If the Chancellor needed inspiration , he should have looked at what the Americans are doing — what the Biden Administration are doing — in investing nearly $ 2 trillion in a rescue plan to generate economic growth , providing much more direct support to small businesses and ensuring that families who desperately need support get much more help .
