# text_id = 1107
# text = As hon . Members know , we have reduced emissions faster than any country in the G7 ; we have announced the £ 2 billion green homes grant scheme ; we were the first major economy to legislate to achieve net zero by 2050 ; and we have generated more electricity from offshore wind than any other country in the world .
