# text = I am new , Madam Deputy Speaker , so perhaps you and other hon . Members will forgive me , but I am mystified as to why the House will , rightly , unite to celebrate our nation ’s many sporting victories , but success on the global economic playing field yields not even a grudging acknowledgement from the Opposition .
