# text_id = 1129
# text = One was that Scotland ’s views were to be completely disregarded , but even more worryingly , we saw the British Government begin to put in place mechanisms to replace the jurisdiction of the European Union that would centralise political power in this country and reduce the capacity and competence of the devolved Administrations in Holyrood and , indeed , Cardiff .
