# text = Will the Minister finally listen to calls from the Victims ’ Commissioner and urgently roll - out section 28 measures to all intimidated witnesses , so that victims of these horrific sexual crimes can give evidence as soon as possible , relieving some of the burden of stress and anxiety that they carry as they journey through our criminal justice system ?
