# text_id = 1160
# text = We have a growing population in Scotland , but if Scotland ’s economy is to continue to grow , there is a concern that , even with freedom of movement , we are not attracting enough people to make up for what will soon become a declining population through a simple lack of natural growth , with deaths already outnumbering births .
