# text = It is my experience , and the experience of my ministerial colleagues , that the civil service is clear that it can offer robust , impartial advice and provide counters from time to time to propositions that are put forward by Ministers , confident in the knowledge that we as Ministers respect the civil service for its independence and integrity .
