# text = May I thank the Prime Minister for the swift action he has taken to deliver this for our country , and will he join me in thanking the many local volunteers , such as Kirsty Griffiths who has been volunteering at the Marlow vaccine centre , and Guy Hollis and Paul Bass who have been volunteering alongside Denham community health centre ?
