# text_id = 1186
# text = As we outlined in the energy White Paper , beyond this extension we are committed to extending the scheme from 2022 until at least 2025 - 26 , and to expanding the spending envelope to £ 475 million to enable us to reach a further 750,000 households , while consulting on reform of the scheme to better target fuel poverty spending .
