# text_id = 1187
# text = Does my hon . Friend agree that “ per capita ” is a much more informative way of describing spending , because demand is increasingly rapidly , with an ageing population that is not ageing healthily , and just talking about the headline numbers does not show whether the amount provided for each person is sufficient to provide their services ?
