# text = One of the innovative ways that pubs and restaurants in Wales have sought to adapt to the covid - 19 restrictions has been to develop , or try to develop , a delivery service , but it has become apparent that the provisions of the Licensing Act 2003 make it difficult for some licensed premises to run such a service .
