# text_id = 1190
# text = Electors of all political persuasions and none , across our kingdom , from Caithness to Caerphilly to Cornwall , from Antrim to Arundel , from Kent to Kendal , expect us to do what they would anticipate is that common sense — to affirm womanhood and motherhood in this legislation , which is , after all , about maternity .
