# text_id = 1202
# text = When the right hon . and learned Gentleman calls for a complete closure of borders , or suggests that that might be an option , he should be aware that 75 % of our medicines come into this country from the European continent , as does 45 % of our food , and 250,000 businesses in this country rely on imports .
