# text_id = 1203
# text = I would be interested to hear the Exchequer Secretary explain why the diverted profits tax increase just maintains the punitive margin between the level of that tax and the increased corporation tax in the years ahead , rather than the decision being made to widen the margin , given how successful the diverted profits tax has been in preventing profit shifting .
