# text_id = 1204
# text = Finally , this Government ’s failure to get a handle on this virus and the procedures of this House during the pandemic have meant that the vital private Member ’s Bill proposed by my hon . Friend the Member for Liverpool , Wavertree ( Paula Barker ) , the National Minimum Wage Bill , has ended up on the chopping block .
