# text_id = 1205
# text = According to the Office for Budget Responsibility , because of the demands of healthcare and social care , if we do not change the tax system and claim more tax , our national debt will grow to three times our GDP — it is one times our GDP today — so we cannot simply scrap taxes without introducing alternative measures .
