# text = Does the Foreign Secretary accept President Biden ’s case that the global threat from ISIS will grow if this remains unaddressed , and given that the Government have it made clear that they do not intend to repatriate British citizens , can he tell me what alternative approach he intends to take in order to deal with this serious security threat ?
