# text_id = 1212
# text = More generally , in the context of the integrated review , one of the powerful themes is the United Kingdom ’s role in the world being joined up , which is why we have brought DFID and the Foreign Office together , in solving disputes , managing conflict and holding the worst perpetrators of human rights abuses to account .
