# text_id = 1213
# text = The 2008 mesothelioma lump sum payment scheme , which I will refer to as the 2008 scheme , was introduced to provide compensation to people who contracted diffuse mesothelioma but were unable to claim compensation under the 1979 Act because , for example , they were self - employed or their exposure to asbestos was not due to their work .
