# text_id = 1215
# text = I share my hon . Friend ’s general hostility to unnecessary regulation of any kind and , believe me , it hurts to do a lot of the things that we have had to do over the last few months , but I see no reason at all why , without being too bureaucratic about it , we should not conduct an assessment of the implications of these measures as well .
