# text = Of course we have to put safety first and of course we have to do the work properly , but we do not need to have a feeding feast over 10 years or 15 years , costing between £ 10 billion and £ 20 billion , with this gold - plated option of demolishing Richmond House , moving out completely and stripping everything out of this building while we are evicted .
