# text_id = 1227
# text = With the current spectacle of mobs being organised by the so - called leader of the free world to try to stop votes being counted in the United States , would this be a timely moment for us to debate the history of people ’s struggle to achieve the vote , and to consider how we can protect our democracy from that kind of toxic politics in the future ?
