# text = I welcome the concessions offered today by the Minister , who I have to say has now listened , in terms of the exclusion of some level of criminal offences punishable by prison , the introduction of a five - year sunset clause , albeit a renewable one , and a prior duty to consult on orders , although only with such persons as the Secretary of State thinks appropriate .
