# text_id = 1231
# text = To do that , we need a legal safety net to protect our country against extreme or irrational interpretations of the protocol that could lead to a border down the Irish sea in a way that I believe , and I think Members around the House believe , would be prejudicial to the interests of the Good Friday agreement and prejudicial to the interests of peace in our country .
