# text_id = 1234
# text = Any extension of the transition period , through which Mr Michel Barnier is outrageously trying to seduce remainers , would simply prolong negotiations ; as David Frost stated , it would create more uncertainty , leaving us paying far more to the EU and binding us to EU laws , when we have democratically and lawfully decided to leave the EU by our own sovereign decision and our own sovereign legislation .
