# text = The national soul - searching of the past four years has demonstrated that there are areas of our country , particularly northern towns such as Penistone and Stocksbridge , that have been left behind — not just in an economic sense , although that is certainly the case , but in terms of how our communities and our culture are understood and valued as part of our national life .
