# text = But what is a matter for the Chair , as Mr Speaker has said many times , and I repeat now , is that if any Government Minister has an announcement to make that is of any importance whatsoever , it should not be made in the pages of newspapers ; it should be made and must be made first here , in this Chamber , to this House .
