# text_id = 1241
# text = There are women in our country behind closed doors pulling down their sleeves and putting on extra make - up to cover up bruises — women checking their bank statements , fearing that they cannot afford a divorce were it to be contested , and knowing that if it were , they would have to battle through the courts and face potential repercussions from their partner before they can escape .
