# text = We always look at the flexibility of support , but we will also make sure , with the safe opening of shops now , that the new normal is coupled with a future view of the high street — the new reality , with changing behaviour of consumers — so that in the years to come independent shopkeepers can sustain and indeed thrive as local businesses on the high street .
