# text_id = 1247
# text = Does my hon . Friend agree with me that the west midlands is the perfect place to welcome a Government Department , and will she pay tribute to the Mayor of the West Midlands , Andy Street , who has been working with Cabinet Office Minister Lord Agnew to make sure that we can take advantage of the economic investment and employment opportunities that relocation would bring to the west midlands ?
