# text_id = 1248
# text = On the point about local democracy , I am sure that the hon . Gentleman will be as pleased as me to note that the plans for local development codes and local style codes , which have to be drafted by local councils — set by them , with local standards — ensure a valid local voice ; it is just doing it in advance , rather than retrospectively .
