# text = I am another Member of the House who must speak up warmly for Chester zoo — a great inspiration to me as a child — and the staff who took the extra time to support me and many of the people who have written in from South Ribble to advocate for the cause , saying how delighted we all are to see that they can start to welcome visitors again .
