# text = On behalf of more than 4.6 million people from across the country who have signed petitions relating to this pandemic and other issues , let me say that we hope this is now the first of many debates we will be able to have , as 29 petitions are waiting to be debated and more are heading toward the 100,000 signature threshold — the petitioners ’ concerns must be heard .
