# text = I can say to my right hon . Friend the Member for Haltemprice and Howden ( Mr Davis ) that the way in which agencies are required to act under the Bill means that they cannot act in a way that is inconsistent with the convention rights , hence the importation by the specific reference to the Human Rights Act on the face of the Bill to underline that .
