# text_id = 1261
# text = The Secretary of State ’s announcement is a delicate balancing act between security , economics and geopolitics , and it shifts the supply of “ Made in China ” equipment from Huawei to “ Made in China ” equipment from the 25,000 Nokia and Ericsson employees there , creating a new duopoly of 5G telecoms provision until such a time as there is a credible Anglo - Saxon alternative .
