# text = I hope the ingenuity and creativity displayed by the Treasury and the Department for Digital , Culture , Media and Sport to date will be replicated in the coming months to give the tourism industry the leg up it so desperately needs to ensure we can welcome international visitors back , as well as those of us visiting parts of the UK to help out in the coming months .
