# text_id = 1267
# text = There is a better way , one that has been referred to by my hon . Friend the Member for Romford ( Andrew Rosindell ) ; we can make sure that equal - sized constituencies can be drawn up that properly represent local constituencies if the boundary commissions are encouraged to look more favourably at dividing wards across constituencies where the alternative would be unnatural constituencies or dividing communities .
