# text = My hon . Friend will be reassured to know that the Archbishop of York told the General Synod in February that the Church needs more priests , not less , and a parish system “ revitalised ” for its future mission to the nation , building on the work that the Church has done so well to tell the good news of Jesus and to meet need during the pandemic .
