# text = As somebody who was also drawn out high up on the private Members ’ Bills ballot a few weeks after I was elected to this House five years ago , I know that , as soon as that result is published , successful Members are not short of advice and suggestions as to measures they might like to pursue , but I think she has chosen extremely well with this Bill .
