# text_id = 1271
# text = The reality is that the blame rests , as my hon . Friend the Member for Eltham ( Clive Efford ) said , with a rushed decision that has changed week after week , and with the Leader of the House not engaging with the Procedure Committee , not working with Members across the House through the usual channels , and , frankly , making it up as he goes along .
