# text_id = 1275
# text = Unfortunately , I do not have any police stations left in my constituency , because the Labour police and crime commissioner for the west midlands decided to spend most of his resources propping up the city centre station , spending £ 30 million on refurbishment rather than using the network of local police stations across the region , such as in Longbridge and King ’s Norton in my constituency .
