# text_id = 1276
# text = The online booking portal available in England , Scotland and Northern Ireland does not function in Wales , and until just days ago , all tests carried out in north Wales were being sent on a several - hour trip to Cardiff for processing , when sending them to the Alderley Park “ mega - lab ” would have reduced lab transfer times to as little as an hour .
