# text = I pay tribute to Dame Inga Beale , who chaired the commission with a firm hand and great style , as well as the hon . Member for Ilford North ( Wes Streeting ) and the eight other commissioners , who put so much into producing what we launched this morning , with the help — wearing a fabulous jacket , if I may say so — of Sir Elton John .
