# text_id = 1286
# text = As a Welsh MP , I am particularly pleased to see the extra £ 740 million for Wales in the Budget , and I only hope that the Welsh Government will spend that money in a timely fashion , rather than continuing their habit over the last year of holding back hundreds of millions of pounds of the UK Government ’s support from those who need it most in Wales .
