# text_id = 1287
# text = On the comments about the measures we are putting in place , how restrictive they are and social distancing , all I can say — and this relates to the number of deaths in hospitals — is that back in March no one was wearing face coverings and no social distancing was being complied with by the public , and the rate of infection was doubling every three to four days .
