# text_id = 1288
# text = I wish the Chancellor had sat down and asked himself when he was writing his Budget what he needed to do to reduce the social and economic divide in the UK and how he would stop those who have done well during the epidemic doing even better in the recovery , while millions more are on a downward slope — the K - shaped recovery that we all want to avoid .
