# text_id = 1289
# text = The aftermath affects the whole country and we need to consider the full scale of the issue , by which I mean many of the aspects that we have started to discuss tonight , including the much wider range of cladding that is believed to be dangerous , such as wooden cladding and other forms of composites , and the lack of fire safety , such as potentially substandard fire doors .
