# text_id = 1290
# text = As we strive to recover from the damage done to so many families and businesses by the pandemic , will the Prime Minister commit to beginning the work on the eastern leg of HS2 , starting in the north - east and to run simultaneously with the construction in the south , so that our region is not forced to wait another couple of decades for 21st - century rail connectivity ?
