# text = I am grateful for the cross-party work that we have done across South Yorkshire , and I want to thank especially my fellow Rotherham area MPs , the hon . Member for Rotherham ( Sarah Champion ) and the right hon . Member for Wentworth and Dearne ( John Healey ) , and the council leader , Chris Reed , for working together with the Mayor to provide cross-party support .
