# text_id = 1294
# text = For that reason , it seems to me that although the measures outlined by the Minister have a bearing on the wider picture of a system that is under pressure , which needs to be debated , they are reasonable , they are proportionate and they have the potential , following an effective period of implementation , to help reduce some of the logjams in the system that impact our children .
