# text = On the hon . Lady ’s point about an Aberdeen postcode , we already have in place a system to ensure that if someone puts in one postcode but then turns up at the wrong drive - through centre , that will be indicated to the people there , so that problem has been resolved — indeed , it had been resolved before it was first raised in the House .
