# text_id = 1307
# text = The £ 20 may be nothing to the Cabinet or to the Prime Minister , who complained that he could not afford to live on a salary of £ 160,000 a year , but for thousands of families across the country , that £ 20 a week is the only thing that stands between them and the food bank , or being able to pay their rent or heat their home .
