# text_id = 1309
# text = Our Government ’s actions to prevent imports associated with the camps from entering this country , by strengthening the Modern Slavery Act 2015 to allow fines for companies that do not comply with transparency obligations , are welcome , but we should always consider ways to exert more pressure on these regimes , such as Magnitsky - style sanctions against listed persons who are complicit in human rights abuses .
