# text_id = 1310
# text = It is the most important time , so I hope — I see the Chancellor of the Duchy of Lancaster in his place — the Government go away tonight and the Prime Minister reflects on what is going on , listens to the concerns of this House and comes back with a solution that allows me to skip through the Lobby on Third Reading and support him on this important Bill .
