# text_id = 1311
# text = I urge the Government , between now and the Bill returning to the other place , to think hard about doing something similar , so that we do not get into a situation where our friends in the Crown dependencies find themselves obliged perhaps to seek legal redress against our own Government and , if need be , to invoke their internal arrangements in relation to a legislative referral procedure .
