# text_id = 1312
# text = Like the right hon . Member for Haltemprice and Howden ( Mr Davis ) , my anxiety from the start has been that two years is a long time to have such draconian measures on the statute book and that to have them on the statute book without a moment when the House , rather than Ministers , can decide to switch individual measures on or off is quite problematic .
