# text = Of course , if we had remained we would still be in those trade agreements with the self - same countries that she mentioned , but we are clear that the UK will remain a strong voice for human rights and that more trade does not have to come at the expense of human rights , and we will continue to encourage all states to uphold international human rights obligations .
