# text = Like many others , it was a delight for me to spend Small Business Saturday in Stoke - on - Trent North , Kidsgrove and Talke visiting local retailers such as Goldenhill Garden Centre , Scott ’s Barbers in Butt Lane , Barewall Art Gallery in Burslem , Abacus Books and Cards in Milton and the lovely Margaret Thelwell , with her vanilla custards , at Tunstall indoor market .
