# text = Nine years ago , we set out an industrial strategy for life sciences , which has paid dividends this year in our ability to deliver a vaccine more quickly than anywhere else in the world , and if we do the same now in bioeconomy , artificial intelligence and robotics , we can do the same again , and the Chancellor has laid the foundations for a decade of growth .
