# text = I have had people say to me , “ Perhaps they just do n’t know how to drive their car , ” but even if someone is not a great driver and is a bit cautious or wobbly when going through the restrictions , is it fair that they should scratch their car , damage their vehicle and face the cost of having to go to a garage to fix it ?
