# text = Over the past two years , if we had not been able to agree with the EU a small quota above scientific advice for cod in the Celtic sea , for example , the choke issue would have led to the closure of many valuable fisheries in the south - west that aim at other species , some of which are certified as sustainable by the Marine Stewardship Council .
