# text_id = 1325
# text = If such a programme is important for the staff in the Home Office , surely it is important for every child being educated in British schools to understand that we are a nation of migrants , that every community and every family has a migration story , that every historical event can be seen from a range of different perspectives and that telling the story of everyone who was there matters .
