# text_id = 1329
# text = Can the Prime Minister explain why a new test centre opening today on Hull University land for students and the local community — a centre that of course I welcome — will be run by private firms Deloitte and G4S with no accountability to local bodies with statutory public health responsibilities to the local community , or to the university , which is of course responsible for its students ?
