# text_id = 1333
# text = In the current situation , where there will be a great desire to probe Treasury Ministers , for economic reasons , and Health Ministers , we do not need changes to questions ; we require the Government to be willing to come forward with regular statements on those issues so the House can use that alternative mechanism , which is inherently more flexible than the written parliamentary question system .
