# text_id = 1334
# text = Those are some queries — fundamental questions , too — that I believe deserve acknowledgement and a response , so I would sincerely appreciate it if the Secretary of State gave further assurances that we are equipped and ready to deal with these changes , and that we will not lose investment at a time when the need to rebuild is stronger than at any time since the second world war .
