# text_id = 1335
# text = Her statement did not tell us in any detail what is actually proposed to be discussed , and it does rather beggar belief that she did not see fit to report to the House the challenges , difficulties and sticking points that she foresees in future negotiations ; nor , I suspect , has she given any comfort to those who raised many significant concerns over accession in the last consultation .
