# text_id = 1339
# text = It is clear that this unprecedented crisis has shown up the historic strengths and weaknesses of our economy and society , the fragility of our global trade and supply links , and the fact that we have for far too long undervalued many of those who are the lifeblood of our economy and society , including our incredible NHS , care and key workers and our small and microbusinesses .
