# text_id = 1341
# text = Frankly , it is a source of shame to me that our Government are being taken to court by them because of our failure as a legislature to introduce a system on self - employment support that recognises the very simple principle that , during the three years that they calculate that self - employment support , some women might have taken maternity leave so their income will have varied .
