# text = Will the Government hold them to tougher environmental targets to achieve our net zero ambition , rather than simply allowing them to go bust through Government inaction and incompetence ? Finally , we have the Home Secretary ambling along this afternoon with a face - saving quarantine plan that has huge consequences for our economy and without any publication of any evidence to support it on public health grounds .
