# text_id = 1355
# text = I urge Treasury Ministers to look again at how the Government can use our taxation system to incentivise the purchase and uptake of new , cleaner internal combustion engine vehicles ; to support our automotive industry to get firing on all cylinders again ; to look at alternative fuels , electric vehicles and hydrogen vehicles ; and to think about how we can really progress and drive the sector forward .
