# text = So while I am of course deeply grateful for the £ 14 million support scheme , my plea to Ministers , on behalf of my constituency zoo and other zoos , as I have heard today from across the country , is to revisit the support package and the eligibility criteria , as many jobs could be lost and animals destroyed if the current six - week model is retained .
