# text = The Prime Minister has dodged these questions all week , and he has dodged them again today , but these questions simply are not going to go away . When exactly was money funnelled through Tory HQ into his personal bank account , when did he pay back this money , was it an interest - free loan , and who are the donor or donors who originally funded it ?
