# text_id = 1359
# text = What I can tell him is that the new CJRS date for eligibility will be 30 October , which means that those who were notified to HMRC at any point up to that time will be eligible to be furloughed under the new scheme and , indeed , those who were let go before the announcement of the plans in September can also be rehired and put back on the scheme .
