# text_id = 1360
# text = Given that this Government have doled out £ 10.5 billion of our money without any competition , according to the National Audit Office , and frittered hundreds of millions on consultants and individuals whose main qualification seems to be that they are friends with members of this Government , does the Minister agree that in any other part of the world it would be called corruption , plain and simple ?
