# text_id = 1365
# text = I urge every Member to look at what is in their inbox , read about the human cost of what it will be like for people if this cut goes ahead , address the worries people have about not being able to put food on the table , and think long and hard about the uncertainty and fear that all families face after 10 long , hard months of this pandemic .
