# text = If it was based on need , it would take account of the fact that business density and the economy of Greater Manchester is bigger than in other areas and that we have many more low - paid workers — that is something that the Secretary of State should know if he is talking about fairness — so businesses in Manchester will actually receive a lot less than businesses elsewhere .
