# text_id = 1375
# text = The petitioners therefore request that the House of Commons urges the Government to bring forward urgent work to adopt the A350 corridor as the main route from the south coast to the M4 , and to consider redirecting east - west traffic from the A4 and Bristol , to the A420 north of the city , thereby protecting Cleveland Bridge from heavy freight traffic and enabling a reduced weight limit .
