# text_id = 1377
# text = I do hope that the Minister will pass on to his colleagues that no matter what we do with this Bill , we need to make sure that we stand up with our Five Eyes partners , now that we have the National Security and Investment Bill and are moving in that direction , and never allow any one of them to be isolated and picked off one at a time .
