# text_id = 1379
# text = I want us to imagine a world where we put a basic tariff on food that is safe but not produced to the standards that we would like to encourage , and zero tariffs on food produced in the way in which we need the world to produce it — with less carbon , less water and less plastic — and to use that to help drive our exports .
