# text_id = 1380
# text = In that vein , in addition to the proposals that he is setting out , will he recognise that we are able to start unlocking the economy today because of the herculean efforts made in areas such as PPE , and the contribution made by the private healthcare sector , which has a valuable role to play as we move towards more of the elective care that we now need ?
