# text_id = 1383
# text = The Minister knows that it is not for the BBC to implement Government welfare plans , so rather than just relying on the BBC writing letters to all over - 75s , will the Minister commit to getting the DWP to start such a campaign , including writing to those pensioners who are entitled to the £ 2.5 billion that remains unclaimed by some of the poorest pensioners across the UK ?
