# text_id = 1384
# text = To ensure that returning healthcare professionals can do so at the right time , when the disease peaks around Easter , we have to move at pace to put the indemnity that he has cited in place , to ensure that people are physically and mentally fit to do this work and , crucially , to ensure that they are skilled or reskilled to do what we are asking of them .
