# text = Secondly , at this dreadful time in our country , when our constituents are suffering financially so severely and our Government are rightly seeking to help every family as we combat the economic effects of this crisis , it is frankly obscene and very offensive that some major corporations who rely on UK customers and make huge profits in our country should not pay their fair share of tax .
