# text = Today , a Commonwealth service leaver with a partner and two children will have to pay almost £ 10,000 to continue to live in the UK , despite those years of service and sacrifice , so will the Government commit to waiving application fees for indefinite leave for all those members of the armed forces on discharge and their families and demonstrate that they really are looking at tackling inequalities ?
