# text_id = 1388
# text = I am grateful that the hon . Gentleman has been able to share with the House some of the latest research from the Children ’s Society , which foresees a bleak outlook if we do not take action on this important issue now , taking the responsibility from local authorities who are stretched as they have never been stretched before in order to make an application on behalf of a child .
