# text_id = 1389
# text = I absolutely support the need for accountability and the proper assessment of where taxpayers ’ money is spent — we absolutely must be responsible about that — but I do not know where it would end under the new clause , because much of the money that we have provided to deal with the coronavirus crisis has been provided through the private sector , not least the loans through the banks .
