# text = Surely we need a strategic approach that deals with those issues — one that protects us from cyber- attacks , obviously , and ensures that we look at the causes of war and that we do not cut overseas aid expenditure but instead increase it , where appropriate , to improve developments around the world and cut down on the enormous gap between the world ’s richest and poorest .
