# text_id = 1391
# text = To anybody who disputes the trajectory of the virus or what the cost of inaction would be , I would point out that when SAGE warned 44 days ago that if we did not act at that time there would be catastrophic consequences , there were then , six weeks or so ago , 11 deaths from covid - 19 , just over 4,000 infections and 181 people on ventilators .
