# text_id = 1392
# text = I want the Chancellor and Treasury Front Bench to make it clear now that every single worker , in every single one of those businesses , will be covered by the 80 % income protection scheme , and that if , as a result of that 20 % cut in incomes , they fall below the thresholds for universal credit or housing benefit , they will be eligible for top-ups .
